---
---
<section class="py-24 bg-white" id="layanan">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <span class="text-primary font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase text-sm mb-2 block">Layanan Utama</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">Katalog Produk & Jasa Produksi</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Spesialisasi kami dalam memproduksi berbagai jenis apparel dengan kapasitas produksi besar dan hasil berkualitas.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      {/* Card 1: Seragam & Kemeja Kerja */}
      <a href="/layanan/seragam-kerja" class="group block overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-white shadow-lg shadow-slate-200/50 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-primary/20 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="h-64 bg-slate-100 overflow-hidden relative">
          <img src="/products/seragam_depan.png" alt="Seragam Kerja" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/60 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-8">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">Seragam & Kemeja Kerja</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6">Produksi kemeja PDH, PDL, kemeja korsa, dan wearpack dengan bahan drill premium standar instansi dan perusahaan.</p>
          <span class="text-primary font-medium flex items-center gap-2">
            Lihat Detail Layanan <svg class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
          </span>
        </div>
      </a>
      
      {/* Card 2: Kaos & Polo Shirt */}
      <a href="/layanan/kaos-polo" class="group block overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-white shadow-lg shadow-slate-200/50 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-primary/20 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="h-64 bg-slate-100 overflow-hidden relative">
          <img src="/products/kemeja_depan.png" alt="Kaos & Polo Shirt" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/60 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-8">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">Kaos & Polo Shirt Custom</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6">Pilihan tepat untuk seragam promosi, event gathering, atau komunitas dengan material katun halus dan bordir/sablon awet.</p>
          <span class="text-primary font-medium flex items-center gap-2">
            Lihat Detail Layanan <svg class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
          </span>
        </div>
      </a>
      
      {/* Card 3: Jaket & Outerwear */}
      <a href="/layanan/jaket-outerwear" class="group block overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-white shadow-lg shadow-slate-200/50 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-primary/20 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="h-64 bg-slate-100 overflow-hidden relative">
          <img src="/products/rompi_depan.png" alt="Jaket & Outerwear" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/60 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-8">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">Jaket, Outerwear & Rompi</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6">Pembuatan jaket bomber, parka, rompi lapangan, dan varsity dengan material anti angin atau water repellent sesuai kebutuhan.</p>
          <span class="text-primary font-medium flex items-center gap-2">
            Lihat Detail Layanan <svg class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
          </span>
        </div>
      </a>
      
      {/* Card 4: Jas Almamater */}
      <a href="/layanan/jas-almamater" class="group block overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-white shadow-lg shadow-slate-200/50 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-primary/20 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="h-64 bg-slate-100 overflow-hidden relative">
          <img src="/products/kemeja_2_depan.png" alt="Jas Almamater & Komunitas" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/60 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-8">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">Jas Almamater & Komunitas</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6">Tingkatkan identitas institusi dan komunitas Anda dengan jas almamater berpotongan rapi, furing nyaman, dan bordir detail.</p>
          <span class="text-primary font-medium flex items-center gap-2">
            Lihat Detail Layanan <svg class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
          </span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
